## 3. pytest Configuration — `pytest.ini`

**File:** `pytest.ini` (repository root)

```ini
[pytest]
testpaths = tests
python_files = test_*.py
python_classes = Test*
python_functions = test_*
addopts = -v --tb=short
```

| Setting | Effect |
|---------|--------|
| `testpaths = tests` | pytest only searches the `tests/` directory |
| `python_files = test_*.py` | Only files matching `test_*.py` are collected |
| `python_classes = Test*` | Only classes starting with `Test` are collected |
| `python_functions = test_*` | Only functions starting with `test_` are collected |
| `addopts = -v --tb=short` | Verbose output + short tracebacks on every run by default |

The SQL-driven tests in `test_sql_runner.py` are collected through the standard
`test_*` function naming convention (`test_sql_case`).

